  "details": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/856620/V__VKatsu/\n\nThe Illusion company's IVR team is currently developing an avatar making software that can be used with your VR devices.\n\nThis is probably great for those who struggle creating their own MMD models. This program could probably relieve a lot of stress from Blender or PMX/PMD editor.\n\nI understand it hasn't come out yet but it would be nice if it gets integrated for VRChat and we can transfer our creations to be used. Maybe someone could create a plugin that export models out.\n\nHopefully we get more information on it and how hard integration can be.",
